ipstack 1.0.1 (vendor/ipstack)
------------------------------

Authors: Narrowlink <opensource@narrowlink.com>
Source: https://github.com/narrowlink/ipstack
License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (vendor/ipstack/LICENSE)

The upstream distribution carries no NOTICE file and no separate copyright
line. The copy in vendor/ipstack is modified: the TCP stream reports end of
file after the peer's FIN, and pending reads and shutdowns are woken when
the connection state changes. Each changed place in the source is marked
with a comment naming the patch.

